00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:54.200
We now wrap this dataframe into a GSQL dataset.

173
00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:59.599
We'll pass the dataframe as a first argument, followed by some optional name to identify

174
00:14:59.599 --> 00:15:00.599
